[I] Output management utility for sway Wayland compositor

[T] nwg-displays is an output management utility for sway, Hyprland, Niri
[T] and mangowm, part of the nwg-shell project and inspired by wdisplays and
[T] wlay. It provides a GUI to arrange multiple displays, apply settings and
[T] save the output configuration and workspace to output assignments to
[T] text files.

[U] https://github.com/nwg-piotr/nwg-displays

